-- C7-1 and C7-2: the web checkout (plan §4.4, §7.4) and Paystack's webhook
-- ledger (`PaymentEvent`, §8.2).
--
-- Generated by `prisma migrate dev --create-only` against the local cnc_db,
-- then the hand-written part appended below the line: the CHECKs that hold
-- a checkout's money, fulfilment, timing and contact to the rules the
-- service applies. `prisma migrate diff --from-config-datasource
-- --to-schema prisma/schema.prisma --script` prints an empty migration once
-- this is applied.
--
-- Applied to CNC staging by hand with `migrate deploy` before the merge that
-- needs it, on the founder's go-ahead (docs/conventions.md, Data and
-- migrations). It reads and writes nothing of TAY's.

